                        "entry_id": "8851a77f-1d5f-3de2-8970-2a57c81cc6c3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A mobile device intermediate in size between smartphone and tablet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c13c2d2-f0fe-4178-bcfa-86eef61afb05",
                                "sense_id": "75d62198-68a6-32da-8a7d-c08af5b53df5",
                                "text": "@JGallo02 With that device it would be worth getting a pay as you go account just for that phablet. I can't wait for them to ship here"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d70f3256-95d6-41ad-b1c4-98d612a29389",
                                "sense_id": "75d62198-68a6-32da-8a7d-c08af5b53df5",
                                "text": "@sloanb phablet? dude, it's an uber-smart-phone with a sick open operating system called #maemo5 #n900 rocks"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc0578b9-3f52-421e-8351-d752e0ddb1bb",
                                "sense_id": "75d62198-68a6-32da-8a7d-c08af5b53df5",
                                "text": "@JGallo02 You guys are marketing it as a internet tablet at all? phablet = Phone/Tablet. And I agree I love Maemo especially V.5"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
